  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Copenhagen Gl\u00f8d Index Close No. Section 01 Home 02 Menus 03 Events 04 Private dining 05 Story No. Section 06 Journal 07 Gift cards 08 Visit 09 Book a table 10 All pages Find us J\u00e6gersborggade 41, 2200 K\u00f8benhavn N Open Wednesday to Saturday, 17:30 to 23:00 Talk to us [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 supper club Long Sunday lunch One table, sixteen seats and a whole lamb from Stevns. Book a seat Book a seat Read more Read more When Sunday 18 October, 12:30 Price 650 kr Seats 16 in total Kind Supper club The evening We push the tables together in the back room and cook a whole lamb from Stevns slowly over the embers all morning. It comes to the table on boards with potatoes from the ashes, bitter leaves and a jug of lamb gravy, followed by cheese and a cardamom cake. Wine is by the bottle, and nobody is in a hurry to leave. How it works Sixteen seats at one long table, so you may end up next to someone new. Lunch starts at 12:30 and usually ends somewhere around five. 650 kr. Tell us about allergies when you book. Book a seat Book a seat Also coming up All events All events 01 08.10 Harvest dinner wine dinner, Thursday19:00 02 19.11 Bread at the fire masterclass, Thur",
